# recipe-lint.legacy - the unbudgeted-poll debt ledger (rule 4).
#
# These recipes already carried a hand-rolled JS poll bound when the rule
# landed: a `for i in <n iterations>; do out=$(jsq ...); sleep N; done` whose
# bound is an iteration count, not a budget - the shape that reds on a loaded
# host and greens solo. The rule is a RATCHET, not a grandfather clause:
#
#   - a recipe NOT listed here may not carry the shape (a new file reds);
#   - a listed recipe may not GAIN one (the count below is checked, not the
#     lines, so an edit above a site cannot hide a new one);
#   - a conversion that removes a site reds as `ledger-rot`, so an entry
#     cannot rot into a silent allowance - the line drops in the same change
#     that converts the last site.
#
# The ledger grants nothing at run time: each listed recipe still waits on its
# hand-rolled bound. Converting one owes its own CI proof, which is why they
# are not mass-rewritten beside a rule landing.
#
# Format: <recipe file> <count of unbudgeted-poll sites>
77-session-branch.sh 9
89-menubar-shape.sh 1
96-browser.journey.sh 6
